477 decisions are based on at least one fact that was later superseded.

I counted a fact as superseded when its status is `superseded`. That gives 600 facts. The 600 facts named in other facts' `supersedes` lists are the same set, so either definition gives the same count. I then counted the decisions in `decisions.jsonl` whose `based_on` list includes at least one of those facts.

{"answer": 477}
